createAsteroidRoom(report)
    Return a room using the shared courtyard renderer, rig and XR session.
    Demand-load the original Asteroid Farmer simulation, storage and geometry.
    On entry load the validated same-origin save and apply bounded away growth.
    Select soil to plant or harvest; select construction to buy it;
    select the neutral ring to settle or the rival ring to attack.
    Use the original simulation for every order and elapsed second.
    Report results, save after actions and ticks, and retain invalid saved bytes.
    While active update crops, raids and ship presentation.
    On exit save, stop ticking and resume only on re-entry.
    Provide floor collision, a Return target and crosshair selection capability.
